    "scenesThatPass": [
      "PATIENT: My room...no, no...this is...this is MY room....\nCHRISTINE: Then if I could just use the phone.",
      "CHRISTINE: Wait...please! There's been a terrible mistake!\nPATIENT: My room. My room. They SAID it was MY ROOM!\nCHRISTINE: I'm sorry, I --\nPATIENT: MY ROOM! MY ROOM! MY ROOM! MY ROOM!",
      "CHRISTINE: You shouldn't have done that.\nCAROL DEXTER: Wanted...to. Felt...good.\nCAROL DEXTER: I lost...two babies...to back alley doctors...no choice.... Never had...the chance...to fight for them. You do. Don't stop.\nCHRISTINE: I won't...I won't.",
      "CAROL DEXTER: I knew you'd come...I knew you'd come back...I knew you'd come....\nCHRISTINE: It's all right...everything's going to be all right now...."
    ]
  },
